<section class="flex flex-col items-center px-8 py-24 text-center">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h2 class="mb-8 text-4xl font-semibold text-black md:text-5xl">Now's my cue.</h2>
    <p class="mb-4 text-xl text-black">
      The world has always been my stage. I loved acting before I even knew what acting was. I
      was enthralled with the work of a voice artist before knowing what exactly a voice artist
      is. I just knew that I loved mimicking voices and making characters come to life through
      their voice.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-8 text-xl text-black">
      Professionally trained and personally perfecting, I pride myself in being a dynamic VO
